  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The SH1.0 to PH2.0 Power Adapter Board enables fast and reliable connections between SH1.0 and PH2.0 interfaces, ensuring stable power delivery for embedded devices and modular systems. It can be paired with a USB-A Power Cable with PH2.0 Connector to supply power to SH1.0-compatible devices, such as the 030 Micro DC Motor with SH1.0 interface."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Application"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Embedded system development: Ideal for prototyping and integrating components in embedded system projects"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Circuit debugging and testing: Simplifies troubleshooting and ensures reliable circuit performance during testing"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Modular device interconnections: Enables seamless connectivity between modular devices for efficient integration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Signal and power transmission for compact devices: Ensures stable signal and power flow in space-constrained device setups"
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><!-- 3D Model --><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/1aa1221248c046bea84058241c61e364/SH1.0_to_PH2.0_Power_Adapter_Board-_XA014_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a> <!-- Introduction --></p>\n<br/>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"SuW6deGP6oNW5jxeKbtcTOQZnHh\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Liv1dXdkRoYdXQxOtrRcWz6Lnwe\">The SH1.0 to PH2.0 Power Adapter Board enables fast and reliable connections between SH1.0 and PH2.0 interfaces, ensuring stable power delivery for embedded devices and modular systems. It can be paired with a <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/collections/cable-connector/products/usb-a-power-cable-with-ph2-0-connector\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>USB-A Power Cable with PH2.0 Connector</strong></span></a> to supply power to SH1.0-compatible devices, such as the <strong><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/030-micro-dc-motor-with-sh1-0\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">030 Micro DC Motor with SH1.0</span></a> </strong>interface.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 图片模块-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/50ffc4d8b6d940b98abbf95deb8d6473/SH1.0_to_PH2.0_Power_Adapter_Board-_XA014.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/50ffc4d8b6d940b98abbf95deb8d6473/SH1.0_to_PH2.0_Power_Adapter_Board-_XA014.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Product Specifications 零件模板 -->\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 120px; width: 111.864%;\"><!-- 物品清单布局 --><!-- 标题加文案结束 --> <!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; height: 40px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div>Connector Type</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">Operating Current <br/>(A)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">Operating Voltage <br/>(V)</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">Product Dimensions<br/>(mm)</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 15px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; text-align: center; height: 15px; width: 13.6939%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">XA014</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 16.6547%; padding: 10px !important;\">\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"OsAldE1cUoGAUQxg1D4cwL9Xnqc\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E2TsdMkJuoukcexwn4Uckptnnqf\">SH1.0 to PH2.0</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 12.5836%; padding: 10px !important;\">1A</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 13.1387%; padding: 10px !important;\">3~6V</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #adadad; height: 15px; width: 15.1743%; padding: 10px !important;\">16.9*10*7.2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br/><!-- Application -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\"></div>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Application</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Embedded system development</strong>: Ideal for prototyping and integrating components in embedded system projects</li>\n<li><strong>Circuit debugging and testing</strong>: Simplifies troubleshooting and ensures reliable circuit performance during testing</li>\n<li><strong>Modular device interconnections</strong>: Enables seamless connectivity between modular devices for efficient integration</li>\n<li><strong>Signal and power transmission for compact devices</strong>: Ensures stable signal and power flow in space-constrained device setups</li>\n<!-- 文本模块 结尾--></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "The SH1.0 to PH2.0 Power Adapter Board enables fast and reliable connections between SH1.0 and PH2.0 interfaces, ensuring stable power delivery for embedded devices and modular systems. It can be paired with a USB-A Power Cable with PH2.0 Connector to supply power to SH1.0-compatible devices, such as the 030 Micro DC Motor with SH1.0 interface.\n\nEmbedded system development: Ideal for prototyping and integrating components in embedded system projects\n\nCircuit debugging and testing: Simplifies troubleshooting and ensures reliable circuit performance during testing\n\nModular device interconnections: Enables seamless connectivity between modular devices for efficient integration\n\nSignal and power transmission for compact devices: Ensures stable signal and power flow in space-constrained device setups",
